JieZi (解字) is a large-scale, expert-audited visual question answering (VQA) dataset dedicated to ancient Chinese character exegesis. It pairs high-quality character glyph images with fine-grained expert annotations across nine paleographic tasks—including headword recognition, etymology, structural analysis, glyph evolution, and component function—providing a rigorous benchmark for multimodal… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Ran0/JieZi.
